=== Integer Type Tests ===
Integer literal: 42 int
Float literal: 42 float
10 + 3 = 13 (type: int )
10 - 3 = 7 (type: int )
10 * 3 = 30 (type: int )
10 / 3 = 3 (type: int - integer division truncates)
10 % 3 = 1 (type: int )
5 (int) + 2.5 (float) = 7.5 (type: float )
5 (int) * 2.5 (float) = 12.5 (type: float )
Array of integers: [1, 2, 3]
First element type: int
Loop iteration 0 (type: int )
Loop iteration 1 (type: int )
Loop iteration 2 (type: int )
Loop iteration 3 (type: int )
Loop iteration 4 (type: int )
substring('hello', 1, 3) = el
repeat('x', 5) = xxxxx
len([1,2,3,4,5]) = 5 (type: int )
10 > 5 = true
10 < 5 = false
10 == 10 = true
5 (int) > 3.5 (float) = true
parse_int('123') = 123 (type: int )
parse_float('123.45') = 123.45 (type: float )

✅ All integer type tests passed!